      "speech": "Remember the RickRoll from the start? That was it. Left, the input video. Middle, its optical flow, which way each pixel moves to the next frame. Right, our warped noise, where every speck travels along that flow. Any single frame is pure static. Only over time can you see Rick. That correlation across time is the control signal."
